    {
      "id": "9e39ddd6-3fb4-428b-b1b3-8f1b3e0f3634",
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "main",
      "text": "How would you debug a page that suddenly takes eight seconds to load in production?",
      "transcript": "First I would check whether it is the network or the main thread using the performance panel, then compare with the last deploy. Usually it is a new bundle or an API call that lost its cache.",
